      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Replace `funcName` Arrays with `__func__`:** Almost every function in `iapcontrol.cc` and `filecontrol.cc` manually defines a local string for logging:\n\n```c\nconst char funcName[] \u003d \"get binary size\";\n```\n\n  This creates unnecessary boilerplate. C++ provides the standard `__func__` macro, which automatically yields the function\u0027s name. I recommend replacing the manual strings with `__func__`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 75,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "53f5e96a6fdf9b8ef17bf51d73af71f1bcc80a46",
